a) Tatuwani hayeikame wimaritsie maiyati, ya hiawariwame mirakaniniki tatuwani xika kahaukuyeixiani, tsepá yiki pita mitiuyuteriwa. 
‘Iki ´ena mirayuxaxata paritiriyu ke´ane mirayu´iwaxi hetsie mieme kapayani xika miki paritiriyu naime ´uwenite ´u´axé, ‘anutiyakameki ´atahaika purutsienituyari wutuki kepaimeme mu´axekai. 
