c) `Ukari kepauka memeyehukani yemeki kwinie mekapite`uximayaka ri yeikame watukari nanaimawame memayehukaki; meneixeiyakakuni xei metseri memayepareki yu`uximayatsikatsie katinuiwawekaku waniwé metá tawari huta metseri menexeiyakakuni mitinuiwatsie yu`iniatati, metepitiarieti yemeki naime ke memite`iwa metá yu`uximayatsika mehexeiyati metá tita nunuwamete memitehexeiya yu`uximayatsikaki. 
